{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":317476,\"title\":\"Huizenruilers\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The housing market is still a disaster. To do something about it, RTL is now launching *Huizenruilers* (House Swappers). This program follows people who are stuck in their current situation. Think of families outgrowing their homes or people who simply want to downsize. Instead of endlessly searching for a new and, above all, suitable place to live, they decide to swap with another household. But there is a small catch!\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fg9PK8cVNlwCqJP7IUBdgIxC7yz.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuoXGO7j1R9Do92voOcWXfi9tes.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":2,\"totalEpisodes\":8,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"RTL 4\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"NL\",\"name\":\"Netherlands\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-07-06\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2048206,\"name\":\"John Williams\",\"character\":\"Self - Presenter\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lTVHEz3saIQHvQx1CcFI5qYtJXq.jpg\"},{\"id\":3572995,\"name\":\"Roos Reedijk\",\"character\":\"Self - Interior stylist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kaHkJCenS4a0OmU7R1Hyenan7oX.jpg\"},{\"id\":4180305,\"name\":\"Daan Alferink\",\"character\":\"Self - Interior stylist\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3VAwVBXcLRGvnSfW7Q8p3qW3aGo.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"EQT-kvilyKE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"WdpjZCLFtt4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"SKQ1tY29a3g\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":291999,\"title\":\"They were 2 fantastic days\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2tuQEJezXJrXHKh6t04rxi65jXR.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4309278350515464,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":100466,\"title\":\"Married at First Sight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tyA5HtEziGBtLSejtK0mb60RSYC.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4246575342465754,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":203656,\"title\":\"The Connection\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ii2gYYIOibD8S5Ic8gXsMzuACh.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42123893805309737,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":131490,\"title\":\"Expedition Gooris\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nZtKgFqwmVC0UC9Fc7kc1z5BopO.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4194805194805195,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":311452,\"title\":\"I’ve Got The Music In Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iZYQEDDYj2DfTaGi6CRX7I2etyv.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4176470588235294,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":238820,\"title\":\"De Frogers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ipbS9r42KStx09AkGs4HXuL5OFE.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41621621621621624,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":225013,\"title\":\"Beste Kijkers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hyYQwFxghrQVTcMw8Tw7jcqfO4o.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41592920353982304,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":20589,\"title\":\"Te land, ter Zee en in de Lucht\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yH7eyzmCD0zedArsFsDGVOIKmhi.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41578947368421054,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":296123,\"title\":\"Kom Je Bij Me Eten? VIPS\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rQygqkjRGVz5GueDlh22cubmevE.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.41481481481481486,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":124035,\"title\":\"I Can See Your Voice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/naoYBImXlwXPGH1xIH4O4j4kkw2.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40882352941176475,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":248760,\"title\":\"De Bauers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gwZZS6x9DyMMFR8IYFowhUKMpf7.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":146127,\"title\":\"Klein maar fijn\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rznH1eS5IM88mLlFhDyJwGp9ZgN.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fg9PK8cVNlwCqJP7IUBdgIxC7yz.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2026-05-18\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Femke, Gijs and Veronique\",\"overview\":\"Femke and her son Gijs from Haarlem have permanently swapped their rental home with Veronique from Hoofddorp. For Femke, who has already moved 25 times and is currently living in a home that is too small, this swap represents a significant improvement in her living situation. Veronique, on the other hand, lives in a home that is too large and, with an eye to the future, wishes to move to a smaller home, preferably in Haarlem. The mediation and support during this home swap have proven to be of great value to both parties.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wH0PFvGhW4P5Y0l4TN3RLxspsGr.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-05-18\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Michael, Michelle and Tilly\",\"overview\":\"Michael and Michelle from Nieuwegein currently live in a single-story home, partly due to Michelle's muscle disease. Their wish is to move with their daughter Sarah to a spacious family home with a garden, where they can enjoy family life to the fullest. Tilly from IJsselstein owns such a house and is more than happy to share it with this family. Stylists Daan and Roos have been given the honorable task of transforming both homes into true little palaces, entirely tailored to the wishes and needs of the residents.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aDWlhJ1aNaK8hkYbwbqIC0CkG4K.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-05-25\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s2GwAYjfNsZ0xq1awKiHFhelyb7.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-06-01\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Sylvia and Yasmin\",\"overview\":\"In Maarssen, mother Sylvia lives with her son Robbey. Sylvia suffers from a severe disability, making her dependent on assistive devices on a daily basis. Tragedy struck one evening when Sylvia fell from her stairlift, an incident that painfully exposed the vulnerability of their living situation. For Robbey, this was the moment to conclude that the current situation is untenable; he wants to move to a single-story home that better meets his mother's care needs.\\n\\nAt the same time, another housing wish is at play elsewhere. Yasmin, a single mother of two daughters, currently lives in a single-story home but dreams of a single-family home where her children have more room to grow up. Two families with divergent but equally urgent housing needs, illustrating how important it is for homes to align with the living circumstances of the residents.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nwHtOK88o9u9A8Wz9lrhpTXv7ce.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-06-08\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Kelly and Yvon\",\"overview\":\"Kelly from Hellevoetsluis combines her role as a mother with running her own business, leaving her days completely full. She struggles with a lack of space in her home: her 12-year-old daughter and 5-year-old son currently share one bedroom. Yvon, 67 years old, works as a bartender in the center of Hellevoetsluis. She lives ten kilometers away in a drive-in house in Brielle. In view of her age and personal circumstances, Yvon wants to move to a smaller home, closer to her work and near her father.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ndmqozozLi9SWoA6gH9wii6ugcx.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-06-15\",\"runtime\":61},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Cherise and Joke\",\"overview\":\"Cherise lives with her two sons in a small apartment in Almere, where the family is struggling with a shortage of rooms. As a result, Cherise is forced to sleep in the living room. 68-year-old Joke, also living in Almere, wishes to move to a smaller, single-level home in view of her future needs and health. Although she has few specific requirements, she possesses a considerable amount of assets.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v9H5juOAuAgdY9pjV9fmm9UtV4.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-06-22\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Patricia and Willeke\",\"overview\":\"Patricia, a single mother, lives with her young son Jaxx in a modest two-room apartment in Spijkenisse. Due to a lack of an extra bedroom, she is forced to place her bed in the living room. In the same city lives 53-year-old Willeke, who has a home that is actually far too large for her situation. Due to her health problems, the maintenance and management of the house constitute a significant burden.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oxvcBFm7CKx0CS8zUzIwegFB2Zb.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-06-29\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Jeanine, Donny, and Else\",\"overview\":\"Jeanine lives with her two teenagers in Bussum, but the family's daily life mainly takes place in Almere. Donny and Else form a blended family and have their home in Almere. However, they cherish the wish to start a new chapter in Bussum, where they would live closer to their work and family, and thus hope to find more connection and ease in their lives.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/omLkRYsu89FGWGiauauXdWa7w5P.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-07-06\",\"runtime\":63}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2026-05-18\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}